   "name": "edible-wild-plants.md",
   "text": "title: Wild plants you can eat\naka: edible plants, edible wild plants, wild edible plants, plants you can eat, wild food, foraging list\ntags: plant wild food index\nlists: wild food\nwarn: Never eat a wild plant you cannot identify with complete certainty. Learn the deadly plants first.\nsource: metos: the wild food entries in this knowledge base\n\nThese wild plants are in this knowledge base. Each one says how to recognise it and which deadly plants look like it. Read the foraging rules and the deadly plants before picking anything.\n\n## also said\n- what can i eat out here\n- which wild plants are safe to eat\n- what plants can i eat\n- edible plants near me\n- is there anything growing here i can eat\n- wild food list\n- what grows outside that you can eat\n- we have no food left, what plants can we eat\n- foraging\n- what can i forage\n- plants that are ok to eat\n- which plants wont kill me if i eat them\n- what can my kids eat from the garden weeds\n- im lost and starving what can i eat in the woods\n- eatable plants\n- wich plant is good for eat\n- food from nature\n- what to eat in the forest\n- list of wild things you can eat\n- can i eat plants i find outside\n- i am hungry, what plants here are food\n- free food growing wild\n- what leaves can you eat\n- edible weeds\n- whats safe to pick and eat around here\n- show me the plants you can eat\n- how do i find food in the wild\n- survival food plants\n- my grandmother used to pick things to eat in the fields, which ones\n- wat plants r edible\n- the shops are empty, can we eat what grows in the park\n- which greens can i gather to eat\n- wild edibles\n- what in the hedges is safe to eat\n- plants for food when there is nothing else\n"
