   "name": "honey-for-cough.md",
   "text": "title: Honey (for cough)\ntags: health remedy\nwarn: Never give honey to infants under 1 year old — it can contain Clostridium botulinum spores that cause infant botulism, a rare but serious illness.\nsource: https://www.cdc.gov/common-cold/treatment/index.html, as summarised by Project NOMAD (home_remedies.json, commit 54ee30a)\nlicence: text Apache-2.0 (Project NOMAD), summarising a US government page (public domain)\norigin: nomad/home_remedies.json#honey-for-cough\n\nHoney may be used to relieve cough in adults and children at least 1 year old. One to two teaspoons can be taken directly or stirred into a warm (not hot) beverage.\n\n## how\nGive one to two teaspoons of honey directly by mouth, or stir it into a warm (not hot) drink. The CDC recommends this as a home measure for cough associated with the common cold.\n\n## evidence\nCDC lists honey among recommended home measures for easing cough and sore throat associated with the common cold; it is one of several non-medication strategies mentioned alongside rest, fluids, and humidifier use.\n\n## safety\nNever give honey to infants under 1 year old — it can contain Clostridium botulinum spores that cause infant botulism, a rare but serious illness. This warning applies regardless of honey type or brand.\n\n## used for\n- Cough\n- Sore throat\n- Common cold\n\n## also said\n- kid keeps coughing all night and cant sleep\n- my daughter is 4 and coughing nonstop, nothing in the house\n- dry tickly cough wont stop\n- cough from a cold, no pharmacy open\n- what can i give a child for cough without medicine\n- how much honey for a cough\n- can i give honey to my baby he is 8 months\n- is honey safe for a toddler cough\n- honey in tea for cough ok?\n- how many spoons of honey for a kid with cough\n- coughing so much my throat hurts\n- grandma has a cough from a cold and no cough syrup\n- cough wont go away after a cold what can i take\n- no cough medicine left what else works\n- my son cough cough cough every night pls help\n- natural cough remedy for kids\n- baby under one year coughing can i use honey\n- old man cough from cold, something gentle\n- tickle in throat makes me cough all the time\n- cold with a cough, how to calm it\n- can honey go in hot water or only warm\n- coughin alot since 3 days, simple thing to take\n"
