   "name": "medicinal-plants.md",
   "text": "title: Medicinal plants\naka: medicinal herbs, healing plants, herbal remedies, herbs that help, plant medicine\ntags: plant medicinal herb index\nlists: medicinal\nwarn: Herbs can be strong, interact with medicines and harm in pregnancy, in children and with long use. Each entry says what is known about whether it works and its cautions.\nsource: metos: the medicinal plant entries in this knowledge base\n\nThese plants are in this knowledge base, with what they are used for, what the evidence says and their cautions. Open one to read it.\n\n## also said\n- which herbs are healing plants\n- medicinal plants\n- what plants can help when someone is sick\n- herbs that heal\n- plants used as medicine\n- natural remedies from plants\n- no pharmacy, what plants can we use instead\n- which herbs are good for health\n- healing herbs list\n- what can i use from the garden as medicine\n- herbal medicine\n- plants that make you feel better\n- my child is unwell and we have no medicine, are there plants that help\n- wich plant is medicine\n- old remedies from plants\n- what did people use before medicine\n- what herbs can i grow for remedies\n- plant medicine list\n- herbes qui soignent\n- is there something growing here that heals\n- grandma remedies with herbs\n- which wild plants are medicinal\n- what herbs do you have\n- healing plants near me\n- remedies from nature\n- do any plants actually work as medicine\n- the doctor is too far away, what plants can help us\n- herbal remedys\n- which plants have medical use\n- teas and herbs that help\n- show me the healing plants\n- what plants are good for treating things\n- first aid plants\n- medecinal herbs\n- what herbs should i keep for when someone gets ill\n"
