   "name": "sowing-calendar.md",
   "text": "title: Sowing calendar for Central Europe\naka: sowing calendar, planting calendar, when to plant, when to sow, garden calendar, seasons\ntags: garden vegetable\nwarn: Dates are approximate for a temperate Central European climate. Watch your local frosts rather than the calendar.\nsee: potato, beans, seed-saving\nsource: compiled from general gardening references, verify before relying on it\n\nThe key date is the last frost, usually around mid May in Central Europe. Tender plants go outside only after it.\n\n## how\nFebruary to March, indoors on a bright windowsill: tomatoes, peppers, leeks.\n\nMarch to April, outdoors: peas, broad beans, onions, radishes, spinach, carrots, lettuce.\n\nApril to early May, outdoors: potatoes, beetroot, chard, more lettuce and radishes.\n\nAfter the last frost, mid May onward: beans, courgettes, squash, cucumbers, maize. Plant out tomatoes and peppers.\n\nJune to July: sow kale, leeks and late carrots for autumn and winter.\n\nAugust to September: winter spinach, lamb's lettuce, winter radish.\n\nOctober: plant garlic and sow broad beans in mild areas.\n\n## also said\n- sowing calendar\n- planting calendar\n- when to plant\n- what can i sow in march\n- what to plant now in april\n- garden schedule for the year\n- when is last frost in central europe\n- when can tomatoes go outside\n- when to start tomatoes and peppers indoors\n- what to sow in february on windowsill\n- is it too late to sow carrots in july\n- what can I still plant in august\n- winter vegetables to sow in september\n- when do i plant garlic\n- sowing broad beans in october\n- when to sow peas\n- when do courgettes and squash go out\n- frost killed my seedlings, I planted too early\n- which vegetables need to wait until after mid may\n- what to plant in june for winter food\n- lamb's lettuce when to sow\n- kale for winter when sow\n- radishes and lettuce timing\n- when to plant onions\n- leeks indoors or out and when\n- planting cucumbers month\n- maize planting time\n- what to sow each month in the garden\n- garden plan for the year to feed my family\n- month by month vegetable planting\n- early spring what to sow outside\n- beetroot and chard when\n- late summer what to sow\n- im in austria when do i start the garden\n- tender plants outside when\n- whats the key date for gardening\n- winter spinach sowing\n"
