   "name": "water-sodis.md",
   "text": "title: Solar water disinfection (SODIS)\naka: sodis, solar disinfection, sun water, bottle in the sun, disinfect water without fire\ntags: water treatment\nwarn: Only works with clear water, in strong sunlight, in clear PET or glass bottles. Does not remove chemicals. Do not rely on it during continuous rain.\nsee: water-boil, water-filter\nsource: Eawag / SODIS manual (2016); SODIS fact sheets (sodis.ch)\n\nSunlight kills germs in clear water through UV light and heat. It needs no fuel and no chemicals, only clear bottles and sun.\n\n## how\n1. Use clean, clear, unscratched PET plastic or glass bottles of up to 2 litres. Remove labels.\n2. Check the water is clear: put the filled bottle on a printed page and look down through it. If you cannot read large letters, filter or settle the water first.\n3. Fill the bottle three quarters full, close it and shake for 20 seconds to add air.\n4. Fill it completely and close it.\n5. Lay it in direct sun, ideally on a metal roof or reflective surface, for at least 6 hours including midday.\n6. If more than half the sky is cloudy, leave it for 2 full days.\n7. Drink directly from the bottle, or pour into a clean cup, to avoid recontaminating it.\n\n## safety\nSODIS does not work in continuous rain, on cloudy water, or in coloured or old scratched bottles. It kills germs but does not remove chemicals or toxins.\n\n## also said\n- sodis\n- solar disinfection\n- bottle in the sun\n- can I make water safe just with the sun\n- leave water bottle in sun to drink\n- no fuel no chemicals how to clean water\n- how long in the sun for water\n- plastic bottle sunlight water treatment\n- what kind of bottle for sun water\n- green bottle sun disinfection ok\n- scratched old bottles sodis\n- 5 litre bottle in sun works?\n- its cloudy today will it work\n- half the sky is cloudy how long\n- does sodis work when it rains\n- shake bottle before putting in sun why\n- water has to be clear for the sun method?\n- how to check if water is clear enough\n- read letters through the bottle test\n- put bottles on metal roof\n- remove the labels from bottles\n- glass bottle in sunlight for drinking water\n- uv from sun kills germs in water\n- disinfect water without fire\n- sun water treatment for kids\n- six hours sun bottle\n- we have lots of pet bottles and sun but no gas\n- does sun bottle remove chemicals\n- pour sodis water into cup or drink from bottle\n- solar water method how\n- sunny day water purify plastic\n- 2 days in sun when overcast\n- can I use a coloured bottle\n- my water is a bit muddy can i still put it in the sun\n- clear bottles on the roof water safe after\n- im in africa sun is strong, can i purify water with bottles\n- summer no electricity how purify water with sun\n"
